        },
        {
          q: 'هل تقصون السجاد على مقاس غرفتي وتركّبونه؟',
          a: 'نعم، نقص السجاد والموكيت على مقاس مكانك بالمتر، ونراجع المقاس معك قبل القص. نركّب ما نوفره، وأجرة التركيب منفصلة وتُتفق حسب المساحة والموقع، ونتابع معك يومين بعد التركيب.',
        },
        {
          q: 'هل يمكن الشراء من الموقع مباشرة؟',
          a: 'لا يوجد بيع إلكتروني ولا دفع في الموقع. الموقع كتالوج للخامات والأسعار، والطلب عبر واتساب: ترسل المقاس والمنطقة ونوع المكان، ونؤكد لك الخيارات والسعر وموعد القياس أو التركيب.',
        },
        {
          q: 'هل توفرون سجاد المساجد والمصليات؟',
          a: 'نعم، نوفر سجاد المساجد والمصليات بالمتر بعرض رول 1.33 م أو 4 م، وبثلاث سماكات: 6 د.ك للخفيف و7 للوسط و8 للسميك للمتر المربع. نقيس في الموقع، ونحاذي الصفوف مع القبلة، ونركّب.',
        },
      ],
    }
  : {
      title: 'Carpets & Rugs in Kuwait, Cut & Installed | Sajjadko Kuwait',
      desc: 'Carpet and rugs in Kuwait from our Al Dajeej store: Turkish carpet, wall-to-wall carpet, hallway runners and mosque carpet, cut to size and installed. 5 to 15 KWD per m².',
      eyebrow: 'Sajjadko Kuwait · Al Dajeej',
      h1: 'Carpets and Rugs in Kuwait, Made to Your Size',
      lead: 'Carpet supply, cutting, hand carving and installation for homes, mosques, offices and projects across Kuwait. Pick a material and colour, send your room size, and we cut and fit it.',
      cta2: 'Browse carpet by the metre',
      trust: [
        'A real store in Al Dajeej to see materials',
        'Priced per m², from 5 to 15 KWD',
        'Cut to your exact room size',
        'Installed, with a two-day follow-up',
      ],
      short: 'In short',
      answer:
        'Sajjadko Kuwait is a carpet store in Al Dajeej selling Turkish carpet, wall-to-wall carpet, hallway runners and mosque carpet by the square metre, cut to your room size and installed. Prices run from 5 to 15 KWD per m² (0.465 to 1.394 KWD per sq ft) depending on thickness and density, and mosque carpet is 6, 7 or 8 KWD per m². Order on WhatsApp: send your size and area, and we confirm options and price.',
      offerTitle: 'What we do',
      products: 'Featured products',
      allProducts: 'All products and colours',
      pricesTitle: 'Prices at a glance',
      priceHead: ['Product or service', 'Price', 'Unit'],
      prices: [
        ['Turkish carpet and wall-to-wall carpet', '5 to 15 KWD', 'per m² (0.465 to 1.394 KWD per sq ft)'],
        ['Mosque and prayer room carpet', '6 / 7 / 8 KWD (light / medium / thick)', 'per m²'],
        ['Red carpet rental', '1 KWD outdoor, 0.750 KWD indoor', 'per m², delivery, laying and removal included'],
        ['Installation', 'Agreed by area and location', 'separate from the carpet price'],
      ],
      priceNote: 'Prices last updated',
      stepsTitle: 'How to order',
      steps: [
        'Measure the length and width of your space, in metres or feet.',
        'Send the size, your area and the type of space on WhatsApp.',
        'Choose the material and colour, and we confirm the price.',
        'We cut and install, then follow up for two days.',
      ],
      whyTitle: 'Why Sajjadko Kuwait',
      why: [
        ['A real store in Al Dajeej', 'See and feel the materials before you order, at Ali Abdulwahab Complex.'],
        ['Clear per-m² pricing', 'We publish the price range for each type, so cost is simply area × price per m².'],
        ['Cut to size', 'No stock sizes to settle for. We check measurements with you before cutting.'],
        [
          'Installation and follow-up',
          'We install what we supply and follow up for two days to fix any installation error.',
        ],
        ['Arabic and English', 'We serve families, companies and expats in Arabic and English.'],
        ['Straight to WhatsApp', 'No accounts, no online payment: one message and you get your options.'],
      ],
      worksTitle: 'Our recent work',
      worksText: 'Jobs we completed recently across Kuwait, with the area and the material used.',
      worksLink: 'See our recent work',
      visitTitle: 'Visit us in Al Dajeej',
      visitText:
        'We serve all of Kuwait from our store in Al Dajeej. Come and see the materials, or send your measurements on WhatsApp.',
      faqTitle: 'Frequently asked questions',
      faq: [
        {
          q: 'What does Sajjadko Kuwait sell?',
          a: 'We sell Turkish carpet, wall-to-wall carpet, hallway runners and mosque and prayer room carpet by the square metre, cut to your size and installed. We also rent red carpet for events and offer hand carving. We do not sell Persian rugs, prayer mats or doormats.',
        },
        {
          q: 'Where is your carpet store in Kuwait?',
          a: 'Our store is in Al Dajeej, Ali Abdulwahab Complex, basement, warehouse no. 3, open 8 AM to 8 PM. Visit to see the materials, or send your measurements on WhatsApp and we reply with options and prices.',
        },
        {
          q: 'How much does carpet cost per square metre in Kuwait?',
          a: 'Turkish carpet and wall-to-wall carpet cost 5 to 15 KWD per m² (0.465 to 1.394 KWD per sq ft), depending on thickness, pile pressure and density. Mosque carpet is 6, 7 or 8 KWD per m². Multiply your floor area by the price per m²; installation is separate.',
        },
        {
          q: 'Can you cut carpet to my room size and install it?',
          a: 'Yes. We cut carpet and wall-to-wall carpet to your room size and check the measurements with you before cutting. We install what we supply; installation is agreed by area and location, and we follow up for two days afterwards.',
        },
        {
          q: 'Can I buy carpet online on this site?',
          a: 'There is no online checkout or payment. The site is a catalogue of materials and prices, and you order on WhatsApp: send your size, area and type of space, and we confirm options, price and a time to measure or install.',
        },
        {
          q: 'Do you supply mosque carpet in Kuwait?',
          a: 'Yes. We supply mosque and prayer room carpet by the metre on 1.33 m (4.4 ft) or 4 m (13.1 ft) rolls, in three thicknesses at 6, 7 or 8 KWD per m². We measure on site, align the rows with the qibla and install.',
